  "builds": [
    {
      "name": "Heavy Bleeding Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Qhira's Heavy Bleeding Build focuses on Qhira's outstanding sustain damage potential. Her main goal should always be to spread the ticking bleeding damage onto several enemies at the same time.\n\nAt Level 4, Qhira can decide which talent to take depending on the situation she finds herself in. We usually recommend picking Upstage, but when you are against Heroes with fast Basic Attacks, like Tracer, Your Pain, My Gain is a good alternative.\n\nFinal Strike is the standard Heroic Ability here, as it will be very effective in most games. However, Unrelenting Strikes is a better choice if enemies cannot easily cancel it. In this scenario you should pick Silent Killer at Level 20, since the Silence and cooldown Reduction provided by it will be excellent in fights.",
